{
    "word": "babushka",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                "word": "babushka",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "57609995-f3b6-4ee9-a28b-306e5d7fd8d6",
                        "entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "babushkas"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "fa13c14a-b289-4465-b85a-f09ebdb70477",
                        "entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "babushki"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6f3b0f57-7911-34c3-8797-a8492881a8ca",
                        "entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An Eastern European old woman."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "863959b3-a222-4dc9-a64e-3401a0e9c4e2",
                                "sense_id": "6f3b0f57-7911-34c3-8797-a8492881a8ca",
                                "text": "Yet, much as I loved to listen to it, standing there in the heat of all the lighted candles and dressed in my heavy shuba and felt boots, I invariably, halfway through the service, would begin to feel an intolerable pain across my shoulders which would spread across my back, gradually getting worse, until in the end I was forced to go to the back of the church and find a corner on a bench especially placed there for all the old babushkas and dedushkas who were also unable to bear the strain of standing throughout the whole service."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ee7fdf0-8895-4684-942a-98959ba13263",
                                "sense_id": "6f3b0f57-7911-34c3-8797-a8492881a8ca",
                                "text": "There was a 92-year-old babushka who was injured, and we put her on the stretcher and helped get her out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e939b250-227b-40a0-b287-5b94321f0a0a",
                                "sense_id": "6f3b0f57-7911-34c3-8797-a8492881a8ca",
                                "text": "As a boy, I hand-made pelmeni with my babushka Alla, my hands and face covered in flour as we worked in the cold of my grandparents’ basement in Paterson, New Jersey."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8a6f1c43-0487-3b1a-8744-ac556d0c1a2c",
                        "entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An Eastern European old woman.",
                            "A Russian grandmother."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51f99ddd-285c-4964-a473-b161f12efbc9",
                                "sense_id": "8a6f1c43-0487-3b1a-8744-ac556d0c1a2c",
                                "text": "I tell thee what, Babushka! I have no time to waste with thee in idle words."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "43510f69-142b-4551-b200-94266221fa4c",
                                "sense_id": "8a6f1c43-0487-3b1a-8744-ac556d0c1a2c",
                                "text": "The young coachman […] not knowing how to treat the old woman: whether with deference as it seemed to him proper, because the old woman wore the same kind of attire as his babushka and the mother of his house did […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "691d8e9d-7df6-48b9-b583-84a1b06a0070",
                                "sense_id": "8a6f1c43-0487-3b1a-8744-ac556d0c1a2c",
                                "text": "There they were, the devoted babushkas and dedushkas, mothers and fathers, sisters and brothers of Bobby’s companions, lugging their bags, their bulging packages and bundles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "310b3576-51bf-4804-9f87-956e37b08a34",
                                "sense_id": "8a6f1c43-0487-3b1a-8744-ac556d0c1a2c",
                                "text": "“He and my babushka took an angry and confused teenager and taught her how to build herself up into a strong woman.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "402e88cd-b273-3cf3-9458-ed3b82e32a6d",
                        "entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A traditional floral headscarf worn by an Eastern European woman, tied under the chin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2bd887f-0e65-4710-9b04-df8505cca7de",
                                "sense_id": "402e88cd-b273-3cf3-9458-ed3b82e32a6d",
                                "text": "White Parian bust of smiling Russian peasant woman - with babushka covering head, lovely detail work, 21½″ tall"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c4b19a0-f903-4f20-b238-340f0e553c75",
                                "sense_id": "402e88cd-b273-3cf3-9458-ed3b82e32a6d",
                                "text": "“Say hello to old Stanley,” he called as she pattered down the steps into the street, flung a babushka over her license plate and screeched away down Telegraph."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba744ea8-f279-4b83-a4b1-9db360d88d3c",
                                "sense_id": "402e88cd-b273-3cf3-9458-ed3b82e32a6d",
                                "text": "The crowd falls silent, momentarily stunned, while a heavyset woman in a babushka pushes her way through, broadcasting the news […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f56eb0b8-a652-3529-85a2-85e774bb9a34",
                        "entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Russian doll, a matryoshka."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ade914e-3ba5-4546-a106-480bfa2b7a34",
                                "sense_id": "f56eb0b8-a652-3529-85a2-85e774bb9a34",
                                "text": "The present inhabitants of the Kremlin […] have rigged the Constitution in a series of articles which fit into each other like those wooden babushkas Russian peasants used to make, so that, as one shell after another is removed, the effective power finally resides in the tiny babushka in the inmost center."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0b9dff3-61d9-43bd-91ef-46d2e9267ea0",
                        "source_entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "source_sense_description": "an old woman",
                        "target_lang_word": "ба́бушка",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ба́бушка",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "707f9f13-f34c-3c54-9455-5f3747b2b4c3",
                                        "entry_id": "741a6c3b-c226-383b-8afb-87f657881f8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "мать отца или матери"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "944533a9-56ea-469e-a0f5-0d93f26333eb",
                                                "sense_id": "707f9f13-f34c-3c54-9455-5f3747b2b4c3",
                                                "text": "Эта чашка была немногим моложе его: бабушка Миля подарила внуку к пятилетнему юбилею и сказала, что надо выпивать все молоко до капли, иначе медвежонок на дне захлебнется."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4648fec1-e775-48d0-8bb7-fd1cc9650cab",
                                                "sense_id": "707f9f13-f34c-3c54-9455-5f3747b2b4c3",
                                                "text": "Я писала к моей бабушке в Москву, изобразила ей несчастное мое положение, но не получила ответа."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dadc7668-7d7d-4307-a5fa-f4c6aa9f7b86",
                                                "sense_id": "707f9f13-f34c-3c54-9455-5f3747b2b4c3",
                                                "text": "Почтительно подошел он к своей бабушке, поцеловал у нее руку и справился о здоровье."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b71d8400-0356-3c1b-a473-271eb3764b6d",
                                        "entry_id": "741a6c3b-c226-383b-8afb-87f657881f8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг. старая женщина"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "118e4670-6e91-4a2c-a1fa-a80964debac6",
                                                "sense_id": "b71d8400-0356-3c1b-a473-271eb3764b6d",
                                                "text": "Внутренне настроив себя на спокойный и конструктивный разговор, она вышла из кабинета, прервав разговор бабушек, которые появлению доктора очень удивились."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfbb0830-fba7-406d-bb29-814f478df52b",
                                                "sense_id": "b71d8400-0356-3c1b-a473-271eb3764b6d",
                                                "text": "Сзади подошли пожилые люди, я сразу хотела уступить место бабушке в бальном платье."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "55bdbbce-077c-4a2b-831c-01c14aa942e2",
                        "source_entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "source_sense_description": "an old woman",
                        "target_lang_word": "стару́ха",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "стару́ха",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33776e86-fe4c-3cff-b174-58e7f183efd8",
                                        "entry_id": "ce2cd31d-9556-3e95-a427-701a8b60c147",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "старая женщина"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "091d801b-0bd6-4481-a087-a0490b4debb7",
                                                "sense_id": "33776e86-fe4c-3cff-b174-58e7f183efd8",
                                                "text": "Глубокая старуха."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45a9d4de-553b-46fb-8c79-4b75374e4df8",
                                                "sense_id": "33776e86-fe4c-3cff-b174-58e7f183efd8",
                                                "text": "Жил старик со своею старухой у самого синего моря."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3dd55660-4cab-3e03-a446-3be2510f302f",
                                        "entry_id": "ce2cd31d-9556-3e95-a427-701a8b60c147",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "фам., ирон. жена или близкая женщина, девушка"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01dbe1bb-7e2a-41e0-bdc5-e5f5a7dc6e91",
                                                "sense_id": "3dd55660-4cab-3e03-a446-3be2510f302f",
                                                "text": "Эй, старуха, куда направляешься?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82b5fd44-aafe-43b5-ad22-266102d5459f",
                                                "sense_id": "3dd55660-4cab-3e03-a446-3be2510f302f",
                                                "text": "Моя старуха на кухне копошится."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "575d1f18-a83c-46fd-a110-57ab9507e960",
                        "source_entry_id": "32cd3c3f-a401-3132-a142-6530ee37a04b",
                        "source_sense_description": "an old woman",
                        "target_lang_word": "стару́шка",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "стару́шка",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1799f7b-9489-3829-ac04-5d9f93bc7614",
                                        "entry_id": "4db63244-0c25-3b5b-8af6-dd97d20c4b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "уменьш.-ласк. к старуха"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40e96ce1-388c-4d0f-b6ae-975bd505e978",
                                                "sense_id": "c1799f7b-9489-3829-ac04-5d9f93bc7614",
                                                "text": "Часы проходили неприметно; после обеда предложена прогулка на взморье, по окончании которой все воротились домой, и старушка принялась за любимое своё препровождение вечера ― гадание в карты."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4933a607-8340-40b1-8de0-c330a6626688",
                                                "sense_id": "c1799f7b-9489-3829-ac04-5d9f93bc7614",
                                                "text": "Это была маленькая и худощавая старушка, державшаяся очень прямо, с мелкими чертами лица, с узенькими и разбегающимися глазками, с остреньким носом, таковым же подбородком и тонкими бледными губами."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5b62b0e-1a40-4385-b304-69ebd5a53a5a",
                                                "sense_id": "c1799f7b-9489-3829-ac04-5d9f93bc7614",
                                                "text": "Старушка, слава богу, здорова и бодра, несмотря на то, что в сентябре ей ми́нуло семьдесят восемь лет."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c66fc74-0e11-4ac1-ae49-3bbb417ea94d",
                                                "sense_id": "c1799f7b-9489-3829-ac04-5d9f93bc7614",
                                                "text": "Его встретила в дверях сама хозяйка, чистенькая старушка лет под шестьдесят."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc48af68-dd13-477c-b774-0d4dd8f576d1",
                                                "sense_id": "c1799f7b-9489-3829-ac04-5d9f93bc7614",
                                                "text": "Только крайний от реки домик, принадлежащий ветхой старушке Поликарповне, во всех отношениях отстал от моды."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
